    summary: "The roles of the German railway system, from the politician to the cleaning staff, in families, with what a game of each needs: setting, decisions and effects, means, limits, personal risks, career and ways in, measures, rhythm, the roles it works with, what it gives to and takes from them, and a mini game; and the qualifications the ways in need.",
