    summary: "Budget Years (Haushaltsjahre): the asset manager of the district around Bf Neustadt, one round a budget year. The maintenance strategy, the renewals, the emergency teams and now and then a proposal of the asset responsible (ALV); then the year plays out: faults, delay minutes, the condition grade, the money.",
